      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/kennedy_alabama",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "By the late 1880s the town boomed, adding general stores, a drugstore, blacksmith shop, jeweler, lumber dealers, and two hotels to serve the growing community.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
