      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/kennedy_alabama",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Kennedy’s climate puts it in Dixie Alley, giving the town a higher tornado risk than the Alabama state average.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
